# Recipe Deck structure

## Interfaces live in type files

- Shared API / WS / slot DTOs: `types/` (`api.ts`, `slot.ts`, `ws.ts`, barrel `index.ts`).
- Feature-local contracts: colocated `*.types.ts` next to the implementation (e.g. `RunningModelPanel.types.ts`, `deckService.types.ts`).
- Do **not** add `export interface` or exported object-shape `export type` in `.tsx` files or in large service modules. Re-export from the implementation file if callers already import from there.

## Line limit

No source file under `client/src`, `server`, `types`, or `shared` may exceed **400** lines (`wc -l`). Split by concern (form vs shell, cache vs logs, route groups) before opening a PR. Gate: `npm run check:lines`.
